"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"88213","synopsis":"The brothers try their hand as streamers after being chastised by their parents for not having jobs. / Iyami uses an experimental detergent to keep his suit clean, but after being confused by the Matsunos as an expensive liquor, is revealed to turn anything invisible (up to a point).","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i7EgyiO34fTWytsCnQnDKtKGdcx.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"88214","synopsis":"Prehistoric versions of the brothers invent ways for them to relive any pent-up urges, with varying degrees of success. / Choromatsu and Ichimatsu struggle to make conversation with each other. / Totoko takes part in an eating contest but keeps getting distracted by the brothers and guest star Shouei.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3LXmQa4CL76pLyHl0uWtLpcKtYP.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"88215","synopsis":"The prehistoric sextuplets return, partaking in dangerous sports. / Noticing their father acting strangely, the brothers discover that he is worried that there's not enough spark in his marriage. After embarrassing himself in front of his sons, Matsuzou considers a love potion from Dekapan, but is this really the best way to patch things up with the love of his life?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bbijFhwAJd0T8ULfVqkSKjfTWgz.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"88216","synopsis":"A series of summer-themed skits. Jyushimatsu takes part in radio exercises, Iyami and Chibita try to beat the heat, Todomatsu keeps finding himself exiled by his brothers, Karamatsu tries to inject summer into everyone's lives, and the sextuplets attempt to talk to girls on the beach.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rCyFxSvBkOv8ow403x1CJKNPepi.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"88217","synopsis":"Iyami mooches off the sextuplets after falling on hard times and Hatabou searches for a friend.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gr4I84pP6aoOH9XCDURgFaYUVZG.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"88218","synopsis":"The prehistoric sextuplets fool with nature for the last time. / In a parody of Romance of the Three Kingdoms, Emperor Osomatsu and a group of bizarre generals attempt to take over the country. / Osomatsu joins Todomatsu at a mixer, struggling to keep his perverted instincts in check.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tXj5lNQdN6mzsny954QJ9TvVele.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"88219","synopsis":"Dayon uses Dekapan's latest invention to merge various people together into new beings, with a fiendish end goal in mind. / Jyushimatsu becomes determined to get a job at a sea park as an actual dolphin, receiving strict training from a familiar female trainer. / Totoko and Nyaa encounter each other at Chibita's oden stand.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sNy6BdjrNQXU3jLlWuIkjQ1Wwgh.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"88220","synopsis":"Ichimatsu struggles to get any sleep with his brothers being noisy all night and refusing to turn off the light. Unable to take anymore, Ichimatsu starts monitoring the brothers' courtesy towards each other, leading Osomatsu to get criticized the most. / Iyami proves his skills at the arcades by playing games at their highest difficulty.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kdG1M5j90Dcc4O1zEnBhw2W4GDi.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"88221","synopsis":"Karamatsu tries to take on various requests from everyone to look like a reliable brother, only to take on more than he can handle, so Choromatsu tries to teach him how to refuse. / Totoko begins working at a company, proving to be a handful for her superior Todomatsu. / A pair of seiyuu attend a dubbing session of an episode of Mr. Osomatsu, witnessing how the sextuplets do their work.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nJFIMUMC4Y0NBI2RQvNE7KZLq4F.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"88222","synopsis":"Already angered over the sextuplets refusing to paying off their oden tab, Chibita vows revenge on them after they pluck out his one-and-only hair. That night, Chibita begins taking out the siblings on by one, shaving all of their hair and stuffing oden in their bodies.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yG1LCkaheiDgAUaBNQ27UAyXESj.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"88223","synopsis":"Jyushimatsu befriends a young boy named Eitarou but gets called in by Eitarou's mother when he starts imitating him. / Dayon steals Dekapan's trademark boxers, forcing him to give chase all over the city and universe in the buff.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cfobGuQxj9sVl7ILf0zpz1ohgDr.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"88224","synopsis":"A series of end-of-year skits. Osomatsu and Choromatsu try to do one thing that could make them say they had a good year, Ichimatsu gets persuaded to take part in a lottery, Dekapan and Dayon pound mochi together, Hatabou gets pestered by some greedy Jizou statues, and Choromatsu sends some untruthful New Years' cards. During the second half, a news crew documents Todomatsu, who was let go from the Matsuno family the previous year and is forced to try out for a reserve team.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/19OcxSdlh77hM2JrquoKbb7Kega.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 14","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"88225","synopsis":"Sanematsu wakes up in Osomatsu's world as the seventh Matsuno brother. / Doo-wah! Cryptid hunters Jyushimatsu, Iyami, and Hatabou go on an expedition to find a Super Mongolian Death Worm. / Choromatsu changes up his image by dying his hair brown, making it hard for his brothers to tell him that it's doesn't actually make him look cool.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lSEx96rbGPxQfPAegsiZK4hGjcZ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 15","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"88226","synopsis":"Doo-wah! Iyami, Jyushimatsu, and Hatabou hunt down the chupacabra. / The brothers struggle to remove the lid off of a particularly stubborn jar. / Karamatsu runs his own taxi service, proving to have no idea what he is doing when he picks up office lady Totoko. / Totty holds a quiz for his brothers, containing several questions without right answers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2ivPlqpl9UrDMFnTgIeT0UATkeA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 16","episodeNumber":16,"sourceEpisodeNumber":16,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"88227","synopsis":"A group of aliens pursue the legendary space pirate, Shazarr. / Displeased with Chibita's oden, Matsuzou serves up his own brand of the dish. / The sextuplets become enamored by their new neighbor, Kinko Inuyama, prompting jealousy from Totoko when they go on a date with Kinko instead of her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zNdfXiaaNAExr1XMQSWtodRbDBY.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 17","episodeNumber":17,"sourceEpisodeNumber":17,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"88228","synopsis":"Doo-wah! The expedition team of Iyami, Jyushimatsu, and Hatabou search for the Devil Yeti. / Ichimatsu becomes paranoid when lucky things happen to him all day, so he and Jyushimatsu try to punish themselves to balance things out. / A lovey-dovey couple go to a hot spring inn that's haunted by a zashiki-warashi named Osoma.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6rsGgDqLO4vqBdD4U6TyzG7VXK0.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 18","episodeNumber":18,"sourceEpisodeNumber":18,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tmdb