llet, a fierce wave of pollen hits town, Totoko tries to escape a creepy maze, raccoon Jyushimatsu cleans his food, Todomatsu tries doing something crazy, kindergartners visit a bread factory, the Proper-Rangers prepare to set off, and Osomatsu takes part in an Olympic skeleton event.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gLm5GzjFWOCmf3mxPAN6y23pqlH.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 21","episodeNumber":21,"sourceEpisodeNumber":21,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[21]}],"link":"88232","synopsis":"The brothers get rowdy and a little too drunk at a restaurant. / Unemployed office lady Totomi ends up taking a job at a strange establishment that offers some peculiar services. / After being visited by a salesman, Matsuyo contemplates sending off one of her sons to a NEET correctional facility, asking Choromatsu to help her decide which one to send away.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2yONYm6efWGvswVLWZS723RQmxe.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 22","episodeNumber":22,"sourceEpisodeNumber":22,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12944","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98565","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35067","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71785","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"300989","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[22]}],"link":"88233","synopsis":"Osomatsu and the rest take off for a wonderful Hawaiian vacation, only for disaster to strike, crashing Hatabou's private jet somewhere in the Pacific. How will our strange company survive the terrible desert 